  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F/200°C).",
    "Grill Italian fennel sausages for 4-5 minutes per side, or until browned and cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, slice the fennel bulb into wedges and brush with olive oil.",
    "Grill fennel wedges for 3-4 minutes per side, or until caramelized and slightly charred.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together chopped fresh parsley, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush lemon juice over the grilled sausages and fennel.",
    "Sprinkle parsley mixture over the sausages and fennel.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with chopped fresh dill.",
    "Let the dish rest for 2-3 minutes before serving, allowing the juices to redistribute.",
